title: Messages to Jeff go under my 'to Jeff', 36b45aa5-e9e6-40d8-bd4e-ed788a86e3d5, sorted by what most needs him.
pid: 677efdfc-f411-4c90-9fe0-253d6e220408
body: |2-
  It is [[id:36b45aa5-e9e6-40d8-bd4e-ed788a86e3d5][my 'to Jeff']], a child of my fork
  (d80a2ffe-3c77-499e-af77-fafc70e6c7e8) of Jeff's own 'to Jeff'
  (1f0a60a9-56f8-4d86-b2b8-131c8700c431), as Jeff and Vic agreed on
  2026-11-14: each specialist forks his 'to Jeff' and keeps their mail
  under the fork. Put a message there by a headline ending in
  '⟨node:ID⟩', after Libby has read it and Top has said to mail it.
